{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-07-11 09:05:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS DELIVERS HIGHER PRODUCTIVITY AND QUALITY FOR ADVANCED-NODE 5G/6G SOCS ON SAMSUNG FOUNDRY'S LOW-POWER PROCESS", 'text': "JOINTLY DEVELOPED END-TO-END RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW AND DESIGN SOLUTIONS KIT, INTEGRATED WITH ANSYS TECHNOLOGIES, SPEED DESIGN CLOSURE MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , JULY 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENABLING MUTUAL CUSTOMERS TO ACCELERATE THEIR DEVELOPMENT OF ADVANCED-NODE RF DESIGNS FOR 5G/6G APPLICATIONS, SYNOPSYS (NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS DEVELOPED AN RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW AND COMPANION DESIGN SOLUTIONS KIT (DSK) THAT ENHANCE PRODUCTIVITY AND SPEED DESIGN CLOSURE ON SAMSUNG FOUNDRY'S 8NM RF LOW-POWER FINFET PROCESS."}